{
  "type": "addon",
  "id": 90,
  "name": "Doc's Weapon Skin Collection",
  "slug": "docs-weapon-skin-collection",
  "teaser": "My personal weapon skins bundled with extra stickers and build codes",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/addons/pcummqK5pcDqQp81GVD4GLm1OKZ3UP21aiSKpv5D.png",
  "downloads": 265,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-2-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h4>A collection of weapon skins and stickers that I made while playing SPT.</h4>\n<p>Most of the skins here are inspired by my favorite characters from:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Girl’s Frontline &amp; Girl’s Frontline 2: Exilium [Most of them uses the GFL2 design]</li>\n<li>Arknights</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These skins are tailored to fit to the showcased gun builds parallel to the builds of the inspired characters.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-2-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Disclaimer</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>There are some camo and masking that I used from other addons that specifically adds custom sticker/camo/masks (I’m sure i didn’t use anything from the ones that add preset weapon skins) for Camo and Sticker mod. So, I suggest that you download all of them if possible (its all good stuff from them)</p>\n<p>For the weapon builds, I used custom attachments that are not available on vanilla SPT, as well these QOL mods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1950/weapon-customizer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Weapon Customizer</a> [For adjusting attachment position on rails]</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2669/weapon-build-master\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Weapon Build Master</a> [For exporting the build codes]</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2578/dagrogsvanillaweaponremix\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">DaGrog’s Vanilla Weapon Remix</a> [Attachment compability, mainly for that one Vector suppressor]</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thus, I suggest that you get most of the weapon and attachments mods available on the forge. If you are in dire, write your comment and I will try pinpointing the exact mod that you need</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-2-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">In-Game Previews</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/soppopreview.png\" alt=\"soppopreview\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/klukaipreview.png\" alt=\"klukaipreview\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/exusiaipreview.png\" alt=\"exusiaipreview\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/UMPSPreview.png\" alt=\"UMPspreview\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/weaponrack.png\" alt=\"rackpreview\" /></p></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<h2>The Skins</h2>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SOPPO</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Colt M4A1 5.56x45 assault rifle (SOPMOD II)</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/SOPPO.png\" alt=\"alt text\" title=\"SOPPO\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">KLUKAI</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>HK 416A5 5.56x45 assault rifle</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/KLUKAI.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"KLUKAI\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">VOYMASTINA</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Kalashnikov AK-15 7.62x39 assault rifle</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/VOYMASTINA1.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"VOYMASTINA1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/VOYMASTINA2.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"VOYMASTINA2\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Note: Not available in vanilla SPT</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">VECTOR</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>TDI KRISS Vector Gen.2 9x19 submachine gun</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/VIVI.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"VECTOR\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">EXUSIAI</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>TDI KRISS Vector Gen.2 .45 ACP submachine gun</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/EXUSIAI.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"EXUSIAI\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">SVETLANA</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>SV-98 7.62x54R bolt-action sniper rifle</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/SVETLANA.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"SVETLANA\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">LEVA</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>HK UMP .45 ACP submachine gun</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/LEVA.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"LEVA\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">LENNA</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>HK UMP 9x19 submachine gun</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/LENNA.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"LENNA\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Note: Not available in vanilla SPT</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-9\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">LAINIE</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>HK UMP .40 S&amp;W submachine gun</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/LAINIE.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"LAINIE\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Note: Not available in vanilla SPT</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-10\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">CHEETA</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>HK MP7A1 4.6x30 submachine gun</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DocFrek/Doc-s-Weapon-Skin-Collection/main/screenshotstash/CHEETA.png\" alt=\"Alt text\" title=\"CHEETA\" /></p></div></div></div>\n<hr />\n<h4>Weapon Builds</h4>\n<p>The necessary weapon builds codes are included in a .txt file inside the ZIP</p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Credits</h4>\n<p>Thank you for all SPT and WTT Community members who had helped me through my experience with SPTarkov and its modding scene.</p>\n<h5>As well as BIG SHOUTOUT for 7Bpencil for making this gem of a mod for SPT</h5>\n",
